    One row per attribute, so A3 (the attribute table) can build from it.
    Reference copy: Groups/GUI (2021-03-09). Bot/ (2021-03-24) is noted only
    where it touches an attribute.
    Population searched for every row and every "not found": Groups/GUI/**
